  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Crlp/1671/2022 on 10 March, 2022 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D. Ramesh The Hon'Ble Sri Justice D. Ramesh Criminal Petition No.1671 Of 2022 Order:",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner would submit that this is a covered matter in view of the earlier common order passed by this Court in Criminal Petition Nos.3731 of 2018 and batch, whereby this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] several Charge Sheets as well as F.I.Rs filed for the similar offences based on identical facts. Therefore, he would submit that the petitioner is similarly placed and therefore, entitled for quash of the Charge Sheet filed against him. 4. Learned Additional Public Prosecutor fairly concedes that this is a covered matter in view of the aforesaid common order passed by this Court and thereby prayed to pass appropriate orders accordingly in this Criminal Petition also.",
